<figure class="swipe-slide"><img src="/carousel/slide-3.jpg" alt="Violet-to-midnight gradient" width="1200" height="675"><figcaption><strong>Forge</strong><span>Electric violet · #6d5ae6</span></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="swipe-slide"><img src="/carousel/slide-4.jpg" alt="Amber-to-umber gradient" width="1200" height="675"><figcaption><strong>Compass</strong><span>Trail amber · #e0894a</span></figcaption></figure>
